**Considering viewport insets**

I’m thinking it might be better to use the visibleBottom based on the overlay viewport rather than the keyboard. If the keyboard inset is greater than the overlay height, that seems like an issue. When testing in an embedded editor, it seems like MediaQuery insets should avoid the keyboard unless the editor is already positioned above it. I want to make sure I’m considering all the possible scenarios for accurate functionality!
